#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Code execution {#code-execution}"
msgstr "Execuția codului {#code-execution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Click **Run** on any code block. The first click starts a Jupyter kernel via"
" [Binder](https://mybinder.org) or [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-"
"engine). After that, runs are instant.\n"
msgstr ""
"Apasă **Run** pe orice bloc de cod. Prima apăsare pornește un kernel Jupyter"
" prin [Binder](https://mybinder.org) sau [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-"
"settings#code-engine). După aceea, rulările sunt instantanee.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Simulator Mode (no account needed)** — Enable [Simulator Mode](/jupyter-"
"settings#execution-mode) to run all notebooks with AerSimulator or noise-"
"model FakeBackends. Zero setup required.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Modul Simulator (fără cont)** — Activează [Modul Simulator](/jupyter-"
"settings#execution-mode) ca să rulezi toate notebook-urile cu AerSimulator "
"sau FakeBackends cu model de zgomot. Zero configurare necesară.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**IBM Quantum Hardware** — Enter your API token and CRN in "
"[Settings](/jupyter-settings#ibm-quantum) once — credentials are auto-"
"injected on every run. [Create a free "
"account](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) if you don't have "
"one.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Hardware IBM Quantum** — Introdu token-ul API și CRN-ul în "
"[Setări](/jupyter-settings#ibm-quantum) o singură dată — credențialele sunt "
"injectate automat la fiecare rulare. [Creează un cont "
"gratuit](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) dacă nu ai unul.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Available execution backends</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Backend-uri de execuție disponibile</summary>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Every tutorial has executable code blocks. Click **Run** to execute them "
"using one of four backends:\n"
msgstr ""
"Fiecare tutorial are blocuri de cod executabile. Apasă **Run** ca să le "
"rulezi folosind unul din cele patru backend-uri:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Binder** (default on GitHub Pages) — Free remote Jupyter kernel via "
"[mybinder.org](https://mybinder.org)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Binder** (implicit pe GitHub Pages) — Kernel Jupyter la distanță gratuit "
"prin [mybinder.org](https://mybinder.org)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**IBM Code Engine** — Serverless Jupyter on your IBM Cloud account. Cold "
"start in seconds instead of minutes. [Set up](/jupyter-settings#code-"
"engine)\n"
msgstr ""
"**IBM Code Engine** — Jupyter serverless pe contul tău IBM Cloud. Cold start"
" în secunde în loc de minute. [Configurează](/jupyter-settings#code-"
"engine)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Local Jupyter (Docker / RasQberry)** — Connects to the local Jupyter "
"server with Qiskit pre-installed\n"
msgstr ""
"**Jupyter Local (Docker / RasQberry)** — Se conectează la serverul Jupyter "
"local cu Qiskit preinstalat\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Custom server** — Point to any Jupyter endpoint in [Settings](/jupyter-"
"settings#advanced-settings)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Server personalizat** — Indică orice endpoint Jupyter în "
"[Setări](/jupyter-settings#advanced-settings)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When multiple backends are available, choose which one to use from "
"[Settings](/jupyter-settings#backend-selection).\n"
msgstr ""
"Când sunt disponibile mai multe backend-uri, alege care să fie folosit din "
"[Setări](/jupyter-settings#backend-selection).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "</details>\n"
msgstr "</details>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Deployment options</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Opțiuni de implementare</summary>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "doQumentation is available as:\n"
msgstr "doQumentation este disponibil ca:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[GitHub Pages](https://doqumentation.org)** — Static site with "
"[Binder](https://mybinder.org) or [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-"
"engine) for remote code execution\n"
msgstr ""
"**[GitHub Pages](https://doqumentation.org)** — Site static cu "
"[Binder](https://mybinder.org) sau [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-"
"engine) pentru execuție de cod la distanță\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[Docker](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/pkgs/container/doqumentation)**"
" — Full stack locally, offline capable\n"
msgstr ""
"**[Docker](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/pkgs/container/doqumentation)**"
" — Full stack local, capabil să funcționeze offline\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[RasQberry](https://rasqberry.org/)** — Self-hosted on Raspberry Pi with "
"local Jupyter kernel\n"
msgstr ""
"**[RasQberry](https://rasqberry.org/)** — Self-hosted pe Raspberry Pi cu "
"kernel Jupyter local\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Run locally with Podman / Docker</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Rulează local cu Podman / Docker</summary>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install [Podman Desktop](https://podman-desktop.io/) or [Docker "
"Desktop](https://www.docker.com/products/docker-desktop/) (Mac / Windows / "
"Linux), then run:\n"
msgstr ""
"Instalează [Podman Desktop](https://podman-desktop.io/) sau [Docker "
"Desktop](https://www.docker.com/products/docker-desktop/) (Mac / Windows / "
"Linux), apoi rulează:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Open [http://localhost:8080](http://localhost:8080) — code execution works "
"locally, no Binder wait time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Deschide [http://localhost:8080](http://localhost:8080) — execuția codului "
"funcționează local, fără timp de așteptare Binder.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "For a lightweight version without local code execution (~60 MB):\n"
msgstr "Pentru o versiune ușoară fără execuție locală de cod (~60 MB):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Using Docker instead? Just replace `podman` with `docker` — the commands are"
" identical. Images are multi-arch (`linux/amd64` + `linux/arm64`), so Apple "
"Silicon Macs work natively.\n"
msgstr ""
"Folosești Docker în schimb? Înlocuiește `podman` cu `docker` — comenzile "
"sunt identice. Imaginile sunt multi-arch (`linux/amd64` + `linux/arm64`), "
"deci Mac-urile Apple Silicon funcționează nativ.\n"
